{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":9,"exerciseID":"02ZKoX5RlhPQGsL0d1T","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":9,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"九年级","queAns":"(1)图见解析(2)图见解析(3)图见解析","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5dfb10fd282fce673fc155d3","queId":"02ZKoX5RlhPQGsL0d1T","schCode":"3032","textbookId":"5dfada3c0248369c447d5ac8"}],"question":"如图，由小正方形构成的6×6网格，每个小正方形的顶点叫做格点，且每个小正方形的边长为1．⊙O经过A，B，C三个格点，仅用无刻度的直尺在给定网格中按要求画图．（保留作图痕迹）(1)在图中的圆中作出圆心O和弧BC的中点D；(2)在图中的弧AC上找一点E，使∠EAC＝45°；(3)在图中的弧AC上找一点F，使CF＝BC．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image30.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image30.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image31.png\">","solution":"(1)取网格点G，连接AG、BG、CG，AB与CG交于点O，结合网格图直接标出BC的中点H，连接OH，并延长交圆于点D，如图，圆心O和弧BC的中点D即为所求．证明：根据网格图可知：BC<sup>2</sup>＝1<sup>2</sup>+2<sup>2</sup>＝5，AB<sup>2</sup>＝5<sup>2</sup>＝25，AC<sup>2</sup>＝4<sup>2</sup>+2<sup>2</sup>＝20，即有：AB<sup>2</sup>＝AC<sup>2</sup>+BC<sup>2</sup>，∴△CAB是直角三角形，∴∠ACB＝90°，即AB是圆的直径，利用勾股定理可得：<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image115.png\">，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image116.png\">，∴结合∠ACB＝90°，可得四边形AGBC是矩形，∴对角线AB与CG的交点O是AB的中点，即点O是圆心，∵点H是BC的中点，∴OH⊥BC，∴根据垂直定理可得：<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image117.png\">，即弧BC的中点为D点；(2)取网格点I、J，连接IJ，连接AJ交圆O于点E，如图，点E即为所求．证明：根据网格图，结合勾股定理可知：<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image118.png\">，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image119.png\">，∴AJ<sup>2</sup>＝IJ<sup>2</sup>+AI<sup>2</sup>，即△AIJ是直角三角形，∵<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image118.png\">，∴△AIJ是等腰直角三角形，∴∠EAI＝45°；(3)取网格点M，连接BM，交圆O点F，如图，点F即为所求．证明：再取网格点N、P，连接CF，CG与BM交于点Q，根据（1）可知CG是圆O的直径，结合网格图可知：在Rt△BMP中，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image120.png\">，在Rt△NCG中，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image121.png\">，∴∠NCG＝∠BMP，∵Rt△NCG中，∠NCG+∠NGC＝90°，∴∠BMG+∠NGC＝90°，∴∠MQG＝90°，∴BF⊥CG，∴根据垂径定理可知：<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image122.png\">，∴CF＝BC．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image123.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image124.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/f2af1bf5-7de6-4759-b4b6-ac0b739be172image125.png\">","subQueNum":0,"subQues":[],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ed8556d518ec3c65e1ea39a","knowName":"用尺规确定特殊位置","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"02ZKoX5RlhPQGsL0d1T","sortIndex":955}]}